 kalbėti lėčiau?","Žinoma, kalbėsiu lėčiau.","Atsiprašau, neišgirdau.","Žinoma!","Jokių problemų.","Be abejo. Pasakysiu lėtai."],"turns":[[0,"Soy Inés. ¿Quiere venir a hacer snorkel un rato?","I'm Inés. Would you like to come snorkeling for a bit?","4d55d5427a7a",3.72],[-1,"Sí, quiero ir.","Yes, I'd like to go.",1],[0,"¿Qué le gustaría ver?","What would you like to see?","2b83c0e1fd2e",1.37],[-1,"Quiero ver los peces.","I'd like to see the fish.",1],[0,"En la bahía nadan peces en grupo.","Fish swim in groups in the bay.","7d229217a0c4",2.94],[0,"Aquí tiene la máscara. ¿Quiere salir ahora?","Here's the mask. Would you like to go now?","e4fe519f29de",2.97],[-1,"Sí, por favor.","Yes, please.",1],[0,"Venga a la plataforma del cenote.","Come to the cenote deck.","31bcc6758b15",2.66],[0,"¡Qué gusto verle de nuevo! ¿Quiere venir a hacer snorkel?","Good to see you again! Would you like to come snorkeling?","a19df18477af",4.17],[-1,"Hoy no, gracias.","Not today, thanks.",1],[-1,"Quiero ver las tortugas.","I'd like to see the turtles.",1],[0,"En la bahía hay tortugas marinas.","There are sea turtles in the bay.","36da0943533c",3.33],[-1,"Perdón, no entiendo.","Sorry, I don't understand.",1],[0,"No hay problema. Lo repito más despacio.","No problem. I'll say it again, more slowly.","1077b1eca063",2.89],[-1,"¡Claro, gracias!","Sure, thanks!",1],[-1,"Perdón, ¿puede repetir?","Sorry, could you say that again?",1],[0,"Por supuesto.","Of course.","0c8f5d95473d",1.28],[-1,"¡Sería genial, gracias!","That would be great, thanks!",1],[-1,"¿Puede hablar más despacio, por favor?","Could you speak more slowly, please?",1],[0,"Claro, le hablo más despacio.","Sure, I'll speak more slowly.","c49098117d0f",1.81],[-1,"Perdón, no escuché bien.","Sorry, I didn't catch that.",1],[0,"¡Claro!","Sure!","f86056836672",1],[0,"Sin problema.","No problem.","49fc7c8e8579",1.34],[0,"Por supuesto. Lo digo despacio.","Of course. I'll say it slowly.","65028d7d122f",2.54]],"contexts":[{"sim":0,"visits":0,"see